        "Content": "Detached four bedroom dormer bungalow.\r\nRequires refurbishment throughout.\r\nQuiet cul de sac location within a mature residential development.\r\nConveniently located within walking distance of Wicklow Town centre.\r\nExtending to approximately 150 sq. m (1,615 sq. ft).\r\nVacant possession.\r\n\r\nThis property provides a detached four bedroom house with a garden to the rear. The property is arranged over ground and one upper floor beneath a pitched roof. This property offers off street parking. We are informed the property extends to approximately 150 sq. m (1,615 sq. ft).\r\n\r\nVacant Possession."
